WEBVTT

00:18.870 --> 00:19.800
What is this for?

00:24.760 --> 00:25.890
I'll unleash my dog.

00:30.440 --> 00:31.570
I'll unleash my dog!

01:16.640 --> 01:17.200
Come on.

01:24.590 --> 01:25.120
All done?

01:40.150 --> 01:41.550
An entire set of 9 pieces.

01:42.920 --> 01:43.850
Not one missing.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.259
Shut the doors.

03:28.100 --> 03:31.910
[Born with Luck]

03:31.930 --> 03:34.850
[Episode 15]

03:34.910 --> 03:36.840
He is a bit shy.

03:37.120 --> 03:40.010
-He is a bit shy.
-He is a bit shy.

03:40.280 --> 03:40.800
Bit.

03:41.310 --> 03:42.290
Bit.

03:42.520 --> 03:43.030
Bit.

03:43.310 --> 03:44.060
Bit.

03:50.240 --> 03:50.710
Halt.

03:56.750 --> 03:57.680
Are you a parent?

04:00.150 --> 04:01.210
Someone's sister?

04:07.080 --> 04:09.540
You're here to learn English
as well, right?

04:13.120 --> 04:14.380
I'm here to take a look.

04:15.470 --> 04:17.750
Too embarrassed to go to an institute
for adults

04:17.750 --> 04:19.610
and afraid of failing to catch up?

04:20.560 --> 04:21.600
This place is great
for learning the basics.

04:21.600 --> 04:23.000
You chose the right spot.

04:26.000 --> 04:27.130
A-Are you listening

04:27.190 --> 04:28.490
to English?

04:28.750 --> 04:29.830
Could you let me hear it?

04:29.830 --> 04:31.430
We can share our experience.

04:31.800 --> 04:32.650
Let me hear it.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.190
It's out of battery.

04:34.190 --> 04:34.990
Take a listen.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.130
What a pity.

04:41.430 --> 04:42.430
Nice to meet you.

04:42.870 --> 04:43.470
I'm Peter.

04:47.070 --> 04:47.600
I'm Cici.

04:56.430 --> 04:58.760
I took English classes with him
for 3 days.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.310
Back in my school days,

05:00.310 --> 05:02.070
I felt sleepy whenever I heard English.

05:02.070 --> 05:04.160
The course lasted from 8 a.m. to 9 a.m.,

05:04.160 --> 05:05.420
and then 8 p.m. to 9 p.m.

05:06.950 --> 05:08.510
You're so lucky to watch Li Penggai,

05:08.510 --> 05:10.310
since you don't need to leave home early

05:10.310 --> 05:11.370
and come home late.

05:12.190 --> 05:13.600
Do you know what kind of sacrifice

05:13.600 --> 05:14.930
I made in the past 3 days?

05:15.540 --> 05:17.350
[Mapleleaf Peninsula]

05:16.480 --> 05:17.160
I went undercover

05:17.160 --> 05:18.720
at the sales centers
of various new-builds.

05:17.470 --> 05:21.850
[Mapleleaf Peninsula,
a 5A-level haven for the body and mind ]

05:22.360 --> 05:22.950
Sir.

05:23.480 --> 05:25.480
Sir, interested in the apartments?

05:25.630 --> 05:26.630
How much per square meter?

05:26.630 --> 05:28.090
How much per square meter?

05:28.240 --> 05:29.560
-Fifteen thousand yuan.
-Thirty thousand yuan.

05:29.560 --> 05:31.560
-Such a low price?
-That expensive?

05:31.950 --> 05:33.680
Since when did you become so rich?

05:33.680 --> 05:34.880
I don't have a budget.

05:35.360 --> 05:36.310
I'll pay as much as it takes.

05:36.310 --> 05:37.280
He took snacks

05:38.000 --> 05:39.200
and stole an umbrella

05:39.750 --> 05:40.920
after seeing the new-builds.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.650
Then, he went to have Malatang.

05:49.270 --> 05:49.680
Bro!

05:51.600 --> 05:53.330
We just met at the sales center.

05:53.390 --> 05:55.190
I had Malatang with him for 3 days.

05:55.190 --> 05:55.680
This is delicious.

05:55.680 --> 05:57.080
I got terrible diarrhea.

06:03.430 --> 06:04.630
Don't get us started.

06:04.640 --> 06:07.300
We had to stake out till early morning
every day.

06:08.630 --> 06:10.070
Mr. Lang, slow down.

06:10.270 --> 06:10.920
Careful.

06:10.590 --> 06:12.110
[Auto focus]

06:12.750 --> 06:13.920
-Bye!
-Bye!

06:14.040 --> 06:14.830
Bye!

06:23.990 --> 06:25.790
[Auto focus]

06:44.970 --> 06:46.500
Team 4 has taken over. Over.

06:52.159 --> 06:52.630
Li Qian?

06:53.159 --> 06:54.310
She's not on our team.

06:54.310 --> 06:55.000
Maybe it's her shift

06:55.000 --> 06:56.130
to watch Hu Jianren.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.020
Ask about that.

06:58.510 --> 07:00.310
Team 1, please respond to Team 4.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.840
Team 1, please respond to Team 4.

07:08.030 --> 07:09.030
There are police.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.990
Team 1, please respond to Team 4.

07:44.170 --> 07:51.960
[Xinda Advertisement]

07:44.850 --> 07:46.380
What kind of driver are you?

07:59.990 --> 08:01.650
How could you drive like that?

08:02.390 --> 08:03.490
I'm really sorry.

08:04.310 --> 08:05.510
C-C-Call the police.

08:09.560 --> 08:11.220
Team 2, get back into your car.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.430
Do not blow your cover at this point.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.600
Observe first.

08:25.680 --> 08:26.830
The driver of the runaway car
takes full responsibility.

08:26.830 --> 08:27.630
Any problem with that?

08:27.630 --> 08:28.190
No.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.800
Your IDs and driver's licenses.

08:35.870 --> 08:36.720
Is this car yours?

08:36.720 --> 08:37.200
No.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.720
It belongs to Rongcheng Group.

08:39.720 --> 08:40.780
It's my boss's car.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.840
What's your boss's name?

08:44.080 --> 08:44.720
Zhou Rong,

08:45.630 --> 08:46.160
Mr. Zhou.

08:47.530 --> 08:48.260
[Traffic Police Unit of Sanjiangkou
Public Security Bureau, Ping'an Province]

08:48.280 --> 08:49.030
[Traffic Accident Ruling]

08:49.790 --> 08:50.390
And yours?

08:50.790 --> 08:52.050
I forgot to bring mine.

08:52.390 --> 08:54.790
Do you or do you not have
a driver's license?

09:00.910 --> 09:01.770
Your ID number?

09:01.870 --> 09:02.550
Ren.

09:03.000 --> 09:03.690
Ren.

09:04.150 --> 09:05.010
What happened?

09:05.270 --> 09:06.090
Nothing.

09:06.360 --> 09:07.870
Just a little fender bender.

09:07.870 --> 09:09.080
The responsibility is all hers.

09:09.080 --> 09:09.670
Cici?

09:12.030 --> 09:12.560
Mr. Zhou,

09:13.120 --> 09:14.580
I've met this girl before.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.480
An acquaintance of yours?

09:16.480 --> 09:17.440
Not really.

09:18.440 --> 09:19.570
How did you meet her?

09:20.120 --> 09:21.720
Just by chance.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.840
Make sure you drive carefully
in the future.

09:25.840 --> 09:26.370
Mr. Zhou,

09:27.360 --> 09:28.750
this has nothing to do with us.

09:28.750 --> 09:29.390
She rear-ended our car.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.000
Gorgeous.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.530
Did you get hurt?

09:32.000 --> 09:32.660
No.

09:33.000 --> 09:33.840
That's good.

09:34.270 --> 09:34.960
The car is mine.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.350
We'll pay for the repair.

09:36.350 --> 09:38.150
How are you involved in this now?

09:38.240 --> 09:39.720
You think that's a proper parking place?

09:39.720 --> 09:40.720
Move your car now!

09:43.510 --> 09:44.970
Don't give her a hard time.

09:47.380 --> 09:48.580
Here, sign your name.

09:58.750 --> 10:00.200
Does she have a driver's license?

10:00.200 --> 10:01.530
Mind your own business.

10:12.720 --> 10:14.240
[Zhang Yi'ang]

10:12.940 --> 10:14.540
Come back to the station now.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.240
One copy for each of you.

10:23.790 --> 10:24.200
What's up

10:24.200 --> 10:25.670
with your luck today?

10:25.690 --> 10:26.220
Oh you...

10:26.550 --> 10:28.080
You crashed the car so soon.

10:28.120 --> 10:28.870
To add to it, Mr. Zhou

10:28.870 --> 10:30.080
and Ren s-saw everything.

10:30.080 --> 10:30.480
Bro,

10:30.840 --> 10:32.310
I am really not to blame.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.510
The car ahead changed lanes
over a solid line.

10:34.510 --> 10:35.720
The one behind rear-ended mine.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.120
None of that was my fault.

10:38.790 --> 10:40.850
Does Ren want me to pay for the repair?

10:41.240 --> 10:42.440
Don't talk nonsense.

10:42.910 --> 10:44.310
Ren is not that petty.

10:45.440 --> 10:46.240
Alright. T-The...

10:46.240 --> 10:47.750
The responsibility is really not yours.

10:47.750 --> 10:48.840
Look, just claim the repair

10:48.840 --> 10:49.900
on insurance.

10:50.750 --> 10:51.960
Alright. Don't be mad.

10:51.960 --> 10:52.560
Calm down.

10:52.960 --> 10:54.020
How can I not be mad?

10:58.030 --> 11:00.200
The thing is, the car ahead ran away.

11:01.240 --> 11:01.960
All the company cars only

11:01.960 --> 11:03.960
have mandatory liability insurance
for traffic accidents.

11:03.960 --> 11:06.360
The company has to pay
for any repair first.

11:06.550 --> 11:07.640
How am I supposed

11:08.080 --> 11:09.780
to talk about that with Ren?

11:09.910 --> 11:10.240
No.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.260
Just be frank with him.

11:12.790 --> 11:14.270
That car ran away.
What's there for us to do?

11:14.270 --> 11:14.730
Well...

11:14.960 --> 11:16.030
When the offending driver is caught,

11:16.030 --> 11:17.270
w-we'll be able to pay the company back,

11:17.270 --> 11:17.960
right?

11:18.240 --> 11:19.320
Should I also be frank with Mr. Zhou

11:19.320 --> 11:20.910
when he asks why I used the car?

11:20.910 --> 11:22.270
Am I going to tell him
that I let my girlfriend

11:22.270 --> 11:23.630
borrow it
for the wedding vendor she works for?

11:23.630 --> 11:24.540
Of course not.

11:24.720 --> 11:25.920
Are you silly or what?

11:30.550 --> 11:31.310
Gai,

11:32.650 --> 11:33.270
you're much

11:33.270 --> 11:34.600
favored by Mr. Zhou now.

11:34.910 --> 11:35.360
You...

11:35.720 --> 11:37.250
You're supposed to be

11:37.840 --> 11:39.210
at the same level as Ren.

11:39.960 --> 11:42.490
How about you put in a good word
for me with Ren?

11:45.120 --> 11:45.670
Wait.

11:46.360 --> 11:49.020
Is it so obvious
that I'm favored by Mr. Zhou now?

11:50.630 --> 11:51.630
Yes, very much so.

11:52.550 --> 11:54.610
Everyone in the company can see that.

11:54.840 --> 11:55.970
Gai, think about it.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.600
Mr. Zhou has a bad temper.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.200
Many of his subordinates

11:59.200 --> 12:01.000
have been sent to transport sand.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.360
Has any of them come back?

12:02.360 --> 12:02.720
Right.

12:02.720 --> 12:03.920
You're an exception.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.390
You're the one and only exception.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.390
Alright, stop it.

12:06.450 --> 12:07.870
If you're not favored by him,

12:07.870 --> 12:08.780
then who is?

12:11.000 --> 12:11.600
Well, I...

12:14.320 --> 12:15.120
Ren is here.

12:15.550 --> 12:16.070
Gai,

12:16.720 --> 12:17.440
you must help me.

12:17.440 --> 12:18.870
This matter involves you too.

12:18.870 --> 12:21.200
It was you who allowed me
to borrow the car.

12:21.890 --> 12:22.440
Fine.

12:22.920 --> 12:24.520
I'll fix the problem for you.

12:30.150 --> 12:30.600
Ren,

12:31.630 --> 12:32.520
well...

12:33.480 --> 12:35.550
Cong had a little crash

12:35.790 --> 12:36.920
when he used the car.

12:37.240 --> 12:39.700
I'll have it fixed
in a friend's repair shop.

12:47.480 --> 12:48.260
Ren...

12:50.910 --> 12:52.510
Do you know why I slapped you?

12:52.790 --> 12:53.920
Didn't I tell you

12:54.000 --> 12:55.230
to behave these days?

12:55.480 --> 12:57.210
But you messed with the police.

12:58.030 --> 12:59.490
It was the traffic police.

13:02.120 --> 13:02.790
Gai...

13:04.320 --> 13:05.920
Not even the traffic police!

13:06.030 --> 13:06.960
What's wrong with you for lending

13:06.960 --> 13:08.510
a company car to your girlfriend?

13:08.510 --> 13:09.720
You will pay

13:10.390 --> 13:11.590
for the car repair.

13:21.080 --> 13:21.720
How much?

13:23.240 --> 13:24.170
But isn't it just

13:24.320 --> 13:26.600
fixing the dented front bumper?

13:27.360 --> 13:29.020
How could it cost 30,000 yuan?

13:30.080 --> 13:30.800
Bro,

13:31.150 --> 13:32.080
this is Mr. Zhou's car.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.430
Mr. Zhou Rong's car.

13:33.630 --> 13:34.760
Let's negotiate it.

13:35.600 --> 13:37.150
Yes. Calculate it again.

13:39.150 --> 13:39.510
No.

13:39.960 --> 13:42.090
Why are you still charging for 30,000?

13:42.390 --> 13:42.910
Hello?

13:44.440 --> 13:45.000
Hello?

13:54.290 --> 13:54.520
[Traffic Accident Ruling]

13:54.540 --> 13:55.110
[Specifics of the accident]

13:55.130 --> 13:56.910
[Signatures of the parties involved:
Du Cong, Li Qian]

14:01.030 --> 14:01.480
Hello.

14:01.750 --> 14:02.560
Hello?

14:03.270 --> 14:04.080
Is it Ms. Li?

14:05.030 --> 14:07.200
I was driving the car
that you just rear-ended.

14:07.200 --> 14:07.860
I'm Du Cong.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.260
What's the matter?

14:11.510 --> 14:14.400
Do you know how traffic accidents

14:15.320 --> 14:16.180
are processed?

14:17.290 --> 14:18.360
No.

14:18.870 --> 14:20.400
Just tell me why you called.

14:22.910 --> 14:24.370
I'd like to claim damages.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.290
Claim damages?

14:25.320 --> 14:27.080
Shouldn't you talk
to the insurance company?

14:27.080 --> 14:28.200
Here's the thing.

14:28.870 --> 14:30.120
That car ahead of me

14:30.320 --> 14:31.680
ran away, didn't it?

14:32.110 --> 14:34.550
At that time, you didn't have your ID on.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.460
According to

14:36.510 --> 14:37.840
the Road Traffic Safety Law

14:37.840 --> 14:39.770
of the People's Republic of China,

14:40.720 --> 14:42.080
you need to pay for damaging

14:42.080 --> 14:43.540
the front bumper of my car.

14:43.600 --> 14:44.870
It's 30,000 yuan in total.

14:44.870 --> 14:47.000
How would you like to make the payment?

14:48.960 --> 14:49.390
Hello?

14:53.390 --> 14:54.240
Hey, Ms. Li.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.770
You can't solve a problem by avoiding it.

14:57.200 --> 14:59.000
I-It's all clearly stated in the law.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.720
The traffic police has records
about the incident.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.530
I don’t have that much money.

15:03.080 --> 15:03.840
Mr. Du,

15:04.600 --> 15:06.480
is there any other solution?

15:10.200 --> 15:11.480
There is indeed

15:12.000 --> 15:12.960
a solution.

15:15.010 --> 15:16.470
Don't give her a hard time.

15:21.150 --> 15:22.000
Plus, I think

15:22.000 --> 15:23.550
it could be a good opportunity

15:23.550 --> 15:24.690
for you.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.390
I work for Rongcheng Group.

15:27.550 --> 15:29.610
You're aware that you damaged

15:29.790 --> 15:31.320
Mr. Zhou Rong's car, right?

15:31.630 --> 15:32.390
Yes, I know.

15:33.000 --> 15:34.030
Mr. Zhou

15:35.030 --> 15:35.830
is single.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.280
I can arrange a meeting for you

15:39.400 --> 15:40.130
and Mr. Zhou,

15:40.550 --> 15:42.240
in which you can own up to your mistake.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.790
If you manage to please

15:43.790 --> 15:44.630
Mr. Zhou,

15:45.120 --> 15:45.780
young lady,

15:46.630 --> 15:48.750
you won't need to pay for the car repair,
will you?

15:48.750 --> 15:49.840
The rest of your life

15:49.840 --> 15:50.870
will be secured.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.670
This is a great opportunity.

15:52.670 --> 15:53.820
I wouldn't even offer it

15:53.820 --> 15:54.790
to my own sister.

15:54.790 --> 15:55.750
But I'm offering it to you now.

15:55.750 --> 15:56.910
Aren't I kind to you?

15:57.680 --> 15:58.680
What do you say?

15:59.150 --> 16:00.800
Thank you so much.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.630
When the meeting is scheduled,

16:02.630 --> 16:03.720
call me anytime.

16:05.080 --> 16:05.600
Okay.

16:12.840 --> 16:13.690
Mr. Guo,

16:13.750 --> 16:15.030
are you really urging me to pay

16:15.030 --> 16:17.290
that mere construction fee of 7 million?

16:17.960 --> 16:19.280
I'm a man of my word.

16:19.360 --> 16:21.360
I'll transfer it to you in a few days.

16:25.500 --> 16:26.140
Well...

16:26.480 --> 16:27.350
Mr. Zhou,

16:27.790 --> 16:28.410
our money

16:28.440 --> 16:29.910
is saved for buying bianzhong.

16:29.910 --> 16:31.110
What should we do now?

16:31.390 --> 16:32.570
Do you know why geese

16:32.600 --> 16:33.910
fly south in winter?

16:34.200 --> 16:34.860
Yes, I know.

16:35.030 --> 16:37.090
Because walking takes too much time.

16:37.360 --> 16:39.360
No, it's because it is too cold
in the north
when winter comes.

16:39.360 --> 16:41.490
Planning ahead is a must. Understood?

16:42.840 --> 16:43.910
Half of the money has been transferred to

16:43.910 --> 16:45.360
to the Republic of St. Marlino.

16:45.360 --> 16:47.820
The other half has been transferred
to Tuva.

16:48.480 --> 16:50.480
It'll travel around the south hemisphere.

16:50.480 --> 16:52.540
By the time the money gets to Okabana,

16:52.630 --> 16:53.320
we'll be watching

16:53.320 --> 16:55.410
the sunset at a beach in Africa.

16:56.390 --> 16:58.450
Nothing has happened lately, has it?

16:59.670 --> 17:01.770
Just one small thing.

17:02.080 --> 17:04.810
Du Cong hopes to apologize to you
for it in person.

17:04.960 --> 17:05.720
That's unnecessary.

17:05.720 --> 17:06.270
Mr. Zhou.

17:11.109 --> 17:12.310
Mr. Zhou, I did wrong.

17:12.589 --> 17:15.520
I shouldn't have used a company car
without consent.

17:19.960 --> 17:20.510
Mr. Zhou.

17:22.000 --> 17:22.660
Mr. Zhou...

17:22.720 --> 17:23.319
Cut it out.

17:24.339 --> 17:25.089
Listen,

17:25.750 --> 17:26.880
Mr. Zhou has been busy

17:26.880 --> 17:27.940
and grumpy lately.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.480
I happen to have some good news

17:29.480 --> 17:30.550
for Mr. Zhou.

17:30.960 --> 17:33.110
Perhaps it'll help him
blow off some steam.

17:33.110 --> 17:34.040
It's a surprise.

17:34.070 --> 17:34.790
No way.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.630
Surprise me first.

17:36.750 --> 17:37.680
What's the news?

17:38.790 --> 17:40.480
Do you remember the girl

17:41.070 --> 17:42.110
who rear-ended our car?

17:42.110 --> 17:43.040
What's with her?

17:43.720 --> 17:45.730
She seems to have a crush

17:45.880 --> 17:47.110
on Mr. Zhou.

17:47.750 --> 17:50.010
So, she asked if I could arrange a meeting

17:50.240 --> 17:51.370
for her and Mr. Zhou.

17:51.790 --> 17:52.650
I'd like to know

17:52.680 --> 17:54.410
if Mr. Zhou is interested in it.

17:54.510 --> 17:56.350
Mr. Zhou did take a few glances at her.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.950
Those were not just glances.

17:58.070 --> 18:00.270
He couldn't take his eyes off her at all.

18:00.720 --> 18:02.850
I've got it all settled with that girl.

18:03.110 --> 18:03.700
Okay.

18:03.790 --> 18:04.550
You did a good job in this.

18:04.550 --> 18:06.410
I'll tell Mr. Zhou the news later.

18:07.160 --> 18:08.000
Does that girl

18:09.310 --> 18:10.370
eat chives?

18:13.040 --> 18:14.210
How would I know?

18:15.070 --> 18:16.800
Just tell her not to eat chives.

18:17.030 --> 18:17.480
Ren.

18:17.480 --> 18:18.240
What now?

18:19.110 --> 18:20.240
Do I still have to...

18:20.720 --> 18:21.980
pay for the car repair?

18:22.550 --> 18:23.410
Yes, of course.

18:23.750 --> 18:25.880
Are you asking me
to pay for your mistake instead?

18:25.880 --> 18:26.720
You're out of your mind.

18:26.720 --> 18:27.320
Go away!

18:28.160 --> 18:28.960
How annoying.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.510
Do not let this man in again.

18:34.200 --> 18:34.860
How are you?

18:37.750 --> 18:38.410
I...

18:38.440 --> 18:39.270
A-Any injuries anywhere?

18:39.270 --> 18:39.680
Just tell me

18:39.680 --> 18:40.480
where you're injured.

18:40.480 --> 18:41.600
I'm not injured.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.860
It was just a rear-end collision.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.160
But the car I rear-ended

18:45.160 --> 18:46.760
belongs to Rongcheng Group.

18:46.790 --> 18:47.200
I know.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.720
Did you tell that driver you're a cop?

18:49.720 --> 18:50.240
No.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.960
It happened when I was on the way

18:52.960 --> 18:53.880
to meet Team 3.

18:58.650 --> 19:00.510
It was really a traffic accident.

19:03.740 --> 19:04.450
It's true!

19:07.030 --> 19:08.790
A situation has come up.

19:09.510 --> 19:11.570
Today, 3 cars rear-ended each other.

19:11.590 --> 19:13.590
The driver of the car ahead has fled.

19:13.790 --> 19:15.110
Just now, the driver of the car
in the middle,

19:15.110 --> 19:16.680
who works for Rongcheng Group,

19:16.680 --> 19:18.240
called and asked me for compensation.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.370
I said I had no money.

19:19.750 --> 19:21.030
Then he said he could arrange

19:21.030 --> 19:22.690
a meeting for me and Zhou Rong,

19:23.160 --> 19:24.830
after which I won't have to
pay for the damage.

19:24.830 --> 19:25.720
A meeting?

19:27.350 --> 19:28.210
Yes, a meeting.

19:29.750 --> 19:30.810
How did you answer?

19:34.110 --> 19:35.370
I-I thought it was

19:35.480 --> 19:36.240
a good opportunity

19:36.240 --> 19:37.090
to approach Zhou Rong.

19:37.090 --> 19:37.750
So, I said yes.

19:37.750 --> 19:38.690
You thought?

19:38.790 --> 19:39.550
Didn't we tell you

19:39.550 --> 19:41.510
the undercover plan wouldn't work?

19:41.510 --> 19:43.160
Why did you take action
without consent again?

19:43.160 --> 19:44.640
I didn't take action without consent.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.830
One thing led to another.

19:45.830 --> 19:46.960
I just had to say yes.

19:46.960 --> 19:47.890
If you disagree with it,

19:47.890 --> 19:48.550
I won't go meet him.

19:48.550 --> 19:49.240
Why are we back

19:49.240 --> 19:50.500
to the undercover plan again?

19:50.500 --> 19:51.160
Didn't we tell you

19:51.160 --> 19:51.880
that it'd at least

19:51.880 --> 19:53.510
take you 3 to 5 years to gain their trust?

19:53.510 --> 19:55.240
Chief Zhang opposed it for your own good.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.030
He's worried about you.

19:56.030 --> 19:56.920
I know.

20:00.440 --> 20:02.100
Alright. Y-You go do your job.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.840
I won't meet with Zhou Rong.

20:13.680 --> 20:14.640
What an upstanding girl, for knowing

20:14.640 --> 20:15.400
that she can't cross the line.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.260
Stop talking.

20:16.510 --> 20:17.370
Unfathomable.

20:29.330 --> 20:31.060
You're disheartened already?

20:35.090 --> 20:36.470
You're so lame.

20:37.040 --> 20:38.640
You still don't know me well.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.200
I always have my friends' backs.

20:41.720 --> 20:44.180
How can I not help you
when you're in trouble?

20:45.000 --> 20:45.900
I've informed

20:46.000 --> 20:46.680
my friends

20:46.680 --> 20:48.080
working in repair shops.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.640
Once this coward sends his car

20:49.640 --> 20:51.070
for repair, I'll know it right away.

20:51.070 --> 20:53.400
Then we can get
the repair fee back, right?

20:56.000 --> 20:56.680
Really?

20:59.640 --> 21:01.070
We'll even extort him and make him

21:01.070 --> 21:02.470
pay more than repair fee.

21:02.750 --> 21:03.960
H-He will have to compensate you.

21:03.960 --> 21:04.810
Yes, extort him.

21:04.810 --> 21:06.410
Let's demand compensation.

21:08.510 --> 21:09.840
I was thinking about...

21:10.640 --> 21:11.270
What?

21:11.980 --> 21:12.980
It's of no use now.

21:14.960 --> 21:15.670
Gai,

21:19.270 --> 21:21.530
I made a right decision of following you.

21:23.960 --> 21:24.510
Cong.

21:25.920 --> 21:26.400
You see,

21:27.840 --> 21:29.900
sometimes, money can buy obedience,

21:30.440 --> 21:31.640
but not loyalty.

21:32.030 --> 21:33.630
As long as you are loyal to me,

21:34.590 --> 21:36.190
you'll have a bright future.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.530
Bro,

21:52.550 --> 21:53.880
I am really starving.

21:55.000 --> 21:57.060
There's only one blade of grass left.

21:57.750 --> 22:00.350
The leaves are for you,
and I'll take the stalk.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.160
What then?

22:04.880 --> 22:06.280
Shall we just wait to die?

22:07.830 --> 22:09.890
Why the topic of death all of a sudden?

22:11.750 --> 22:13.210
When someone passes here,

22:13.270 --> 22:14.750
we'll be saved, right?

22:16.270 --> 22:17.240
It's been 3 days.

22:18.830 --> 22:20.350
Has anyone passed by?

22:30.830 --> 22:31.960
Someone's up there.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.110
Wait, bro,

22:44.750 --> 22:46.170
he can help us out, right?

22:46.720 --> 22:47.920
Who else other than those from the court

22:47.920 --> 22:48.850
would come here?

22:51.580 --> 22:52.770
Even if they help us out,

22:52.770 --> 22:53.870
will they let us go?

23:52.310 --> 23:52.960
What for?

23:53.070 --> 23:54.130
Grocery delivery.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.740
Grocery delivery?

24:04.050 --> 24:05.520
You didn't use to serve us, did you?

24:05.520 --> 24:06.920
No, we didn't. We're newly hired.

24:06.920 --> 24:08.510
Our company is getting started.

24:08.510 --> 24:09.400
So the prices are low.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.580
Yes, low prices.

24:12.270 --> 24:13.130
Open the trunk.

24:13.240 --> 24:14.040
-Sure.
-Sure.

24:14.070 --> 24:14.600
Show him.

24:14.720 --> 24:15.070
Yes.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.830
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

24:25.480 --> 24:26.010
Alright.

24:26.310 --> 24:27.310
Drive the truck in.

24:27.310 --> 24:27.640
Okay.

24:30.070 --> 24:30.500
Okay.

24:30.520 --> 24:31.320
Open the gate.

24:40.540 --> 24:41.270
Uncle Yifei,

24:41.800 --> 24:43.200
no problem. Our plan is working.

24:41.890 --> 24:45.800
[Baoku Fresh Produce]

24:44.030 --> 24:45.360
We can proceed anytime.

24:54.030 --> 24:54.750
Mr. Zhou,

24:55.000 --> 24:55.920
Zhu Yifei called and scheduled

24:55.920 --> 24:57.510
the transaction for tomorrow.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.200
Tomorrow?

24:59.790 --> 25:01.070
Didn't we agree to postpone it?

25:01.070 --> 25:02.670
Why did he move it up instead?

25:02.720 --> 25:03.480
Do people in this line

25:03.480 --> 25:04.750
of business just act at will?

25:04.750 --> 25:05.880
He'll do as we asked.

25:05.880 --> 25:07.240
Tomorrow, he'll bring the bianzhong over

25:07.240 --> 25:08.070
for us to check.

25:08.070 --> 25:09.310
If there's no problem,

25:09.310 --> 25:10.830
we'll make the transaction.

25:10.830 --> 25:12.090
Is the money prepared?

25:13.000 --> 25:14.270
Contact Fang Yong then.

25:14.270 --> 25:15.110
Have him examine the items himself.

25:15.110 --> 25:15.510
Got it.

25:16.440 --> 25:18.070
As long as we land on
the East New Town project,

25:18.070 --> 25:18.750
all the problems

25:18.750 --> 25:19.910
will be solved.

25:21.240 --> 25:21.820
Mr. Zhou,

25:23.350 --> 25:25.480
you've worked really hard these days.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.840
Li Penggai is here.

25:31.270 --> 25:32.730
Would you like to meet him?

25:33.680 --> 25:35.350
He's been through a lot as well,

25:35.350 --> 25:37.590
for eating dust
at the construction site for days.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.720
He must feel bitter.

25:38.720 --> 25:40.450
I'm sure he needs your comfort.

25:40.750 --> 25:42.280
Is it what a boss needs to do?

25:43.030 --> 25:44.230
But if I do it instead,

25:44.550 --> 25:46.340
he won't feel your care for him.

25:47.920 --> 25:48.550
Let him in.

25:50.350 --> 25:51.480
Li Penggai, come in!

25:57.880 --> 25:58.700
Mr. Zhou!

25:59.240 --> 26:00.000
D-Don't kneel.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.330
G-Give him 10,000 yuan.

26:02.920 --> 26:03.580
No, 20,000.

26:03.720 --> 26:04.290
Get up.

26:04.480 --> 26:05.010
Mr. Zhou,

26:05.350 --> 26:06.410
I don't want money.

26:07.510 --> 26:08.510
I hope to stay around you.

26:08.510 --> 26:09.510
I'm done working on the construction site.

26:09.510 --> 26:10.610
I understand why you make me go there,

26:10.610 --> 26:12.240
but I still want to stay with you
and serve you.

26:12.240 --> 26:13.200
Why must you stick with me?

26:13.200 --> 26:14.180
This is a reward

26:14.240 --> 26:15.300
for your hard work.

26:15.400 --> 26:17.510
Mr. Zhou, I really don't want any money.

26:17.510 --> 26:19.310
All I want is to stay by your side.

26:20.310 --> 26:21.000
I know...

26:22.350 --> 26:23.480
among all the people around you,

26:23.480 --> 26:24.680
Ren is only loyal one.

26:24.750 --> 26:26.080
I want to be a second one.

26:26.440 --> 26:27.640
As you said, Mr. Zhou,

26:27.750 --> 26:29.150
money can buy obedience,

26:29.550 --> 26:30.590
but not loyalty.

26:32.150 --> 26:33.680
It sounds quite familiar.

26:41.160 --> 26:42.560
When did you

26:43.070 --> 26:44.420
hear me say that?

26:45.680 --> 26:46.540
Half a year ago,

26:47.680 --> 26:49.140
that rainy and windy night

26:50.350 --> 26:51.950
left a deep impression on me.

26:54.790 --> 26:55.790
Move it a bit more.

26:56.070 --> 26:56.590
Stop!

26:56.640 --> 26:57.640
Let me take a look.

27:01.350 --> 27:02.310
All of you, get out.

27:02.310 --> 27:03.030
It's almost done, Mr. Zhou.

27:03.030 --> 27:03.520
Get out!

27:05.070 --> 27:05.880
Now!

27:16.200 --> 27:17.200
Where is my phone?

27:20.560 --> 27:22.020
Did I leave it in the study?

27:38.400 --> 27:39.510
W-Will I be scolded

27:39.510 --> 27:40.640
if I get in there now?

27:40.920 --> 27:41.750
Dial my number.

27:41.750 --> 27:42.610
Do it yourself.

27:50.510 --> 27:51.000
Bowen.

28:00.920 --> 28:02.320
Money can buy obedience,

28:02.340 --> 28:03.590
but not loyalty.

28:04.890 --> 28:06.020
Among all the people

28:06.350 --> 28:07.550
around me now, you are

28:07.890 --> 28:08.950
the only loyal one.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.210
Mr. Zhou knows

28:21.920 --> 28:23.050
what's on your mind.

28:23.310 --> 28:23.720
Here.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.070
Take the money.

28:25.680 --> 28:26.200
Is it appropriate?

28:26.200 --> 28:26.640
Scram.

28:26.830 --> 28:27.310
Fine.

28:35.400 --> 28:36.110
Why did he bring up

28:36.110 --> 28:37.440
what happened that day?

28:48.310 --> 28:49.070
All of you, get out.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.110
It's almost done, Mr. Zhou.

28:50.110 --> 28:50.850
Get out!

28:51.850 --> 28:52.610
Let's go.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.480
Now!

29:00.880 --> 29:01.350
Bowen.

29:23.920 --> 29:24.830
How very nice.

29:35.270 --> 29:35.800
Mr. Zhou,

29:36.680 --> 29:37.740
I finished the task

29:37.830 --> 29:39.000
without anyone knowing.

29:39.000 --> 29:39.930
It was flawless.

29:40.200 --> 29:41.640
Why did you have to kill him?

29:41.640 --> 29:42.880
He was chief
of the Public Security Bureau.

29:42.880 --> 29:43.510
Deputy chief.

29:43.510 --> 29:44.510
That is no excuse!

29:46.400 --> 29:47.830
Lu Zheng stood in your way

29:47.830 --> 29:48.830
several times,

29:49.030 --> 29:50.160
and picked on Ye Jian.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.550
You said that you wanted him dead,

29:51.550 --> 29:53.200
so that everyone would know
who's in charge of Sanjiangkou.

29:53.200 --> 29:56.130
I was just saying it.
How could it be taken seriously?

29:56.310 --> 29:58.240
Find something to smash the phone!

29:59.000 --> 29:59.570
Mr. Zhou,

30:00.110 --> 30:01.270
I took the risk of killing him

30:01.270 --> 30:03.200
-on your order.
-What was my order?

30:04.070 --> 30:05.480
I already killed Lu Zheng.

30:05.480 --> 30:07.540
You have to keep your promise, right?

30:07.720 --> 30:09.050
Come here. Give it to me!

30:10.160 --> 30:10.950
Give it to me.

30:12.270 --> 30:12.930
Mr. Zhou...

30:25.880 --> 30:26.480
Burn it.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.280
Mr. Zhou,

30:46.030 --> 30:47.310
Lu Zheng's death is good news

30:47.310 --> 30:48.130
to us.

30:48.830 --> 30:50.270
From now on, in Sanjiangkou,

30:50.270 --> 30:51.790
nobody will dare stand in your way.

30:51.790 --> 30:52.440
Bowen,

30:53.480 --> 30:55.210
I’ll give you what you deserve.

30:55.350 --> 30:56.640
Just keep this matter secret,

30:56.640 --> 30:57.120
okay?

30:57.680 --> 30:58.410
Don't worry.

30:58.830 --> 31:00.830
It's all been burned into ashes now.

31:01.880 --> 31:02.880
Thanks, Mr. Zhou.

31:12.030 --> 31:12.590
Mr. Zhou,

31:13.920 --> 31:15.520
what is done can't be undone.

31:16.160 --> 31:17.290
Don't overthink it.

31:28.270 --> 31:29.670
Money can buy obedience,

31:31.270 --> 31:32.200
but not loyalty.

31:34.270 --> 31:35.670
Now, among all the people

31:36.400 --> 31:37.480
around me, you are

31:39.880 --> 31:40.940
the only loyal one.

31:51.270 --> 31:53.030
He heard what I said to you.

31:53.750 --> 31:55.550
Did he also hear what Lang Bowen

31:56.000 --> 31:57.230
did to Lu Zheng?

31:57.440 --> 31:58.110
Li Penggai definitely

31:58.110 --> 31:59.370
doesn't know about it.

32:00.290 --> 32:01.960
I have a bad feeling about this.

32:01.960 --> 32:03.420
He doesn't know, Mr. Zhou.

32:06.030 --> 32:07.070
Just be wary of him.

32:07.070 --> 32:07.480
Got it.

32:08.350 --> 32:09.280
Go get prepared.

32:09.550 --> 32:11.680
No mistake is allowed
for tomorrow's transaction.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.410
Understood.

32:26.310 --> 32:27.350
Hu Jianren works

32:27.640 --> 32:29.070
in the office during the day,

32:29.070 --> 32:31.240
and attends English classes after work.

32:31.240 --> 32:32.470
He speaks English when he

32:32.470 --> 32:33.720
orders food and puts gas in his car.

32:33.720 --> 32:35.830
He even listens to English
in the bathroom.

32:35.830 --> 32:38.030
There's nothing suspicious about him.

32:38.070 --> 32:39.240
As for Li Penggai,

32:39.750 --> 32:41.200
he has been to all the new-builds

32:41.200 --> 32:42.860
and 4S stores in Sanjiangkou.

32:43.790 --> 32:46.590
The most suspicious of all
is that Malatang place.

32:46.960 --> 32:47.690
Chief Zhang,

32:48.030 --> 32:50.480
I got food poisoning.
Does it count as work injury?

32:50.480 --> 32:51.610
What about you guys?

32:52.000 --> 32:53.440
Any findings?

32:55.400 --> 32:56.930
Chief Zhang, Captain Wang,

32:57.200 --> 32:59.200
we can't go on like this forever.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.710
So chatty today, aren't you?

33:02.200 --> 33:02.880
Don't you think Chief Zhang

33:02.880 --> 33:04.880
also knows we can't do this forever?

33:05.160 --> 33:06.510
But what other solutions are there

33:06.510 --> 33:08.310
except for what we're doing now?

33:13.110 --> 33:13.710
Everyone,

33:15.350 --> 33:17.480
you've worked really hard these days.

33:17.510 --> 33:19.030
But our efforts

33:19.480 --> 33:20.540
didn't go to waste.

33:20.920 --> 33:21.920
They've paid off.

33:24.240 --> 33:25.770
Have you ever thought about

33:27.110 --> 33:28.720
why Zhou Rong's gang

33:28.960 --> 33:29.890
has been so quiet

33:30.920 --> 33:31.820
in recent days?

33:37.270 --> 33:39.470
Silence often falls before a great war.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.900
I believe they will

33:42.960 --> 33:44.610
make a big move tomorrow.

33:45.680 --> 33:47.200
Why does it have to be tomorrow?

33:47.200 --> 33:48.200
Why can't it be...

33:50.830 --> 33:51.960
It must be tomorrow.

33:53.400 --> 33:55.140
I just reported to Chief Zhang

33:55.790 --> 33:57.030
that Hu Jianren asked for leave

33:57.030 --> 33:58.890
from his English class tomorrow.

34:03.640 --> 34:04.700
As the saying goes,

34:06.270 --> 34:08.000
"Feign when the enemy is weary;

34:08.670 --> 34:10.330
wait when the enemy is hungry;

34:10.630 --> 34:12.070
strike when the enemy is at ease."

34:12.070 --> 34:13.670
This is what we're thinking.

34:14.280 --> 34:16.050
I bet Zhou Rong and his fellows also think

34:16.050 --> 34:17.650
this is what we're thinking.

34:17.960 --> 34:20.219
So, they'll surely make a move tomorrow.

34:20.630 --> 34:22.030
We need to send them a message

34:22.030 --> 34:22.800
through action

34:22.800 --> 34:23.670
that their guess

34:23.670 --> 34:25.330
about our guess is incorrect.

34:25.630 --> 34:27.290
The final battle is tomorrow.

34:28.630 --> 34:29.070
Okay.

34:35.590 --> 34:36.630
Li Qian, you don't need to take part

34:36.630 --> 34:38.090
in tomorrow's operation.

34:38.320 --> 34:39.000
Why?

34:40.030 --> 34:41.000
A more important task

34:41.000 --> 34:41.659
awaits you.

34:46.070 --> 34:46.670
Eat up.

34:52.920 --> 34:54.520
Mr. Zhou needs a car tomorrow

34:54.550 --> 34:55.590
to pick up a big shot.

34:55.590 --> 34:56.880
Is that S600 model fixed?

34:56.880 --> 34:57.720
Yes, Bowen.

34:58.110 --> 35:00.510
Who's the big shot?
I'll pick him up myself.

35:01.480 --> 35:02.740
Let someone else do it.

35:03.070 --> 35:04.280
Mr. Zhou has an important task

35:04.280 --> 35:04.920
for you.

35:07.030 --> 35:07.710
Okay.

35:07.920 --> 35:09.330
T-Then let's send Du Cong to it.

35:09.330 --> 35:10.070
Though he often takes

35:10.070 --> 35:11.000
advantage of everything,

35:11.000 --> 35:13.510
he's the most reliable
among all our fellows.

35:13.510 --> 35:14.570
You handle it then.

35:24.150 --> 35:25.230
Why did you pull up the car here?

35:25.230 --> 35:26.360
It's blocking the way.

35:26.360 --> 35:28.160
I left you some space there, see?

35:58.230 --> 35:58.880
Are you...

35:59.190 --> 36:00.060
Mr. Fang?

36:05.760 --> 36:07.420
Why such an eye-catching car?

36:07.440 --> 36:08.230
Picking up a big shot like you

36:08.230 --> 36:09.830
calls for a presentable car.

36:10.000 --> 36:10.630
Hurry and leave.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.150
Get a move on.

36:11.150 --> 36:13.680
I pulled up the car here
for your convenience.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.110
How many savory crispy crepes?

36:32.110 --> 36:32.530
Two.

36:32.590 --> 36:33.030
Got it.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.280
Here you are.

36:35.710 --> 36:36.210
Thanks.

36:36.320 --> 36:37.710
Alright. Take care.
Don't forget your soy milk.

36:37.710 --> 36:38.440
Here you are.

36:39.670 --> 36:40.520
Okay, bye.

36:42.320 --> 36:44.110
I thought it was an important task.

36:44.110 --> 36:46.770
As it turns out,
I'm only assigned to fix the car.

36:48.990 --> 36:50.560
[No riding, dancing, singing, or gathering
in the parking lot]

36:50.580 --> 36:51.510
[Any consequences will be on you]

37:00.710 --> 37:03.010
[No riding, dancing, singing, or gathering
in the parking lot]

37:03.030 --> 37:05.260
[Any consequences will be on you]

37:05.800 --> 37:06.930
I have to hang up now.

37:18.960 --> 37:20.880
Place the 8 large ones in this truck.

37:20.880 --> 37:21.840
Be gentle.

37:29.070 --> 37:31.000
Have Liu Bei carry the small one.

37:31.070 --> 37:32.230
[Baoku Fresh Produce]

37:31.110 --> 37:31.770
Be careful.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.150
Here.

37:35.480 --> 37:36.650
Boss, here you are.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.170
Five.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.110
Here, six.

37:39.960 --> 37:40.590
Seven.

38:10.070 --> 38:10.620
Come on.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.170
Is all the stuff loaded?

38:12.630 --> 38:13.740
Shut the rear door.

38:15.610 --> 38:16.540
Close that door.

38:26.400 --> 38:28.260
After I enter that place,

38:28.630 --> 38:29.630
I'll call you.

38:30.190 --> 38:31.150
During the entire time,

38:31.150 --> 38:32.920
do not contact anyone.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.030
Got it.

38:34.320 --> 38:35.180
Repeat it then.

38:35.760 --> 38:37.220
I must not contact anyone.

38:41.000 --> 38:41.480
Uncle,

38:42.150 --> 38:44.510
we're bringing only one bianzhong piece
for the buyer to check.

38:44.510 --> 38:46.480
Is there anything odd about this buyer?

38:46.480 --> 38:47.540
In doing business,

38:48.530 --> 38:50.510
I never present all the goods first.

38:50.510 --> 38:52.420
Buyers have to pay up
before examining the goods.

38:52.420 --> 38:54.920
I'll give you your pay
once the money arrives.

38:54.920 --> 38:56.000
In half an hour,

38:56.670 --> 38:58.070
the piece you're holding

38:58.280 --> 38:59.740
and the other 8 in the truck

38:59.870 --> 39:01.590
will be gathered as a complete set

39:01.590 --> 39:02.850
and given to the buyer.

39:03.030 --> 39:04.150
This is my rule.

39:05.630 --> 39:06.890
How thoughtful of you.

39:08.510 --> 39:09.880
This is a very big deal.

39:10.440 --> 39:12.670
There are so many connections to grease,

39:12.670 --> 39:14.150
and so many buddies to pay.

39:15.480 --> 39:17.540
You promised to give me 800,000 yuan.

39:17.590 --> 39:19.050
Then how do you make money?

39:21.000 --> 39:22.930
You think I'm doing this for money?

39:27.670 --> 39:30.330
I've been in this line of business
my whole life.

39:32.150 --> 39:33.350
I just can't leave it.

39:36.630 --> 39:37.280
Time to set out!

39:37.280 --> 39:37.670
Okay.

39:55.210 --> 40:01.500
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

40:11.710 --> 40:12.510
Drive slower.

40:13.960 --> 40:14.660
[Baoku Fresh Produce]
